  {
   "id": "t872332248",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 110.0,
   "y": 935.0,
   "width": 1583.3999999999999,
   "height": 18.2,
   "strokeColor": "#22C55E",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "media_book \u00b7 media_film \u00b7 media_series are NOT built in Phase 1. They are named so the shape is visibly extensible \u2014 and so finding F-1 (film and series are two types, not one) is not rediscovered later.",
   "originalText": "media_book \u00b7 media_film \u00b7 media_series are NOT built in Phase 1. They are named so the shape is visibly extensible \u2014 and so finding F-1 (film and series are two types, not one) is not rediscovered later.",
