   "height": 18.2,
   "strokeColor": "#9D7BFF",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "effective_status is NOT stored. It is derived on read:  status_manual ?? derive(progress, capabilities).  ONE function, every media type \u2014 see 11-media-model.md.",
