   "strokeColor": "#94A3B8",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "text": "KEY    violet = the media item    \u00b7    green = its typed extension    \u00b7    blue = sync bookkeeping    \u00b7    grey = local-only, never syncs    \u00b7    red = deliberately OUTSIDE the library file",
